@host = https://localhost:7043
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@snapshotId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiCredential = replace-with-monitoring-read-credential

### Private source states and current snapshot identifiers.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}

### First chunk of the current dpkg snapshot (source 3).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/inventory/3/snapshots/{{snapshotId}}/chunks/0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}

### Private inventory changes in a UTC time range.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/inventory/changes?from=2026-11-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&until=2026-11-02T00%3A00%3A00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}
